# Butler Routes - Dun Morogh recipes and patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans, schematics, designs and manuals whose SOURCE is
# physically in Dun Morogh (Coldridge Valley included), verified against the local
# Forever game data (questie-forever item, vendor and drop tables). Two recipes
# are vendor-sold and one drops exclusively from a Dun Morogh mob; every other
# dropped recipe is a generic multi-zone world drop, and quest records carry no
# reward data (see docs/companion-unverified.md). No Blacksmithing plan has a Dun
# Morogh source in the data — smithing country or not, none ships. Trainer-taught
# staples are excluded: Polestar's own profession guides cover those. Each step is
# gated to its profession; other characters skip it cleanly.
guide butler-routes-completionist/dun-morogh-recipes
title Dun Morogh - Recipes & Patterns
levels 1-12
zone Dun Morogh
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords dun morogh, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Cooking — Gretta Ganter
  when skill Cooking 1

  vendor 8508 -- Gretta Ganter (31.53, 44.65)
  buy 6325 "Recipe: Brilliant Smallfish"
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

step Cooking — Frostmane Seer (rare drop)
  when skill Cooking 1

  loop
  goto 40.34,42.86
  goto 40.67,34.98
  goto 41.09,44.87
  goto 41.14,45.54
  goto 41.16,44.47
  goto 41.28,34.34
  goto 41.48,45.01
  goto 41.54,35.32
  goto 41.62,43.82
  goto 41.81,35.62
  goto 42.07,34.35
  goto 42.1,45.52
  goto 42.11,44.59
  goto 42.25,36.6
  goto 42.31,34.93
  goto 42.46,35.79
  goto 42.55,33.75
  goto 42.82,36.59
  goto 43.06,35.86
  collect 249879 "Recipe: Peace Tea" optional
  note Dropped only by the Frostmane Seer, a common troll of the Frostmane hold, and by nothing else anywhere in the data.

step Engineering — Namdo Bizzfizzle
  when skill Engineering 1

  vendor 2683 -- Namdo Bizzfizzle (21.86, 31.86)
  buy 14639 "Schematic: Minor Recombobulator"
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.
